, shrunk average of a player's strokes gained, the number the forecasts use.","pct":false},{"id":"sg","label":"Strokes gained per round","short":"SG/rd","family":"value","dir":"higher","unit":"strokes per round v an average field","tip":"Strokes gained per round against an average field over the window, shrunk toward the peer average.","pct":false},{"id":"form","label":"Form: strokes gained, last 8 events","short":"Form","family":"value","dir":"higher","unit":"strokes per round","tip":"Strokes gained per round over the player's last eight events: who is playing well now.","pct":false},{"id":"sg_e","label":"Strokes gained, rounds 1 and 2","short":"R1-2","family":"scoring","dir":"higher","unit":"strokes per round","tip":"Rounds 1 and 2: before the cut, in a full field.","pct":false},{"id":"sg_w","label":"Strokes gained at the weekend","short":"Wknd","family":"scoring","dir":"higher","unit":"strokes per round","tip":"Rounds 3 and 4: after the cut, usually in contention or chasing.","pct":false},{"id":"sg_f","label":"Strokes gained, front nine","short":"Front","family":"scoring","dir":"higher","unit":"strokes per nine","tip":"The front nine against the field's average front nine that day (strength-adjusted, like every number here).","pct":false},{"id":"sg_b","label":"Strokes gained, back nine","short":"Back","family":"scoring","dir":"higher","unit":"strokes per nine","tip":"The back nine, the same way. Front plus back is the round.","pct":false},{"id":"sd","label":"Round-to-round spread","short":"Spread","family":"scoring","dir":"lower","unit":"strokes (one standard deviation)","tip":"One standard deviation of the player's strokes gained from round to round, after their own average: lower is steadier.","pct":false},{"id":"great","label":"Great rounds (+3 or better)","short":"Great","family":"scoring","dir":"higher","unit":"share of rounds","tip":"Share of rounds three or more strokes better than an average field would have shot.","pct":true},{"id":"poor","label":"Poor r